<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-HEINEKEN TROPHY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HEINEKEN TROPHY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROSMALEN, Netherlands 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>Heineken Trophy tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seed):</p>
<p>Men's semifinals:</p>
<p>3-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat 1-Michael Chang (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-7 (5-7) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Guillaume Raoux (France) beat 4-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 6-0 6-1</p>
</text>
